  "worked_solution": "First, note that\n\n$$\n\u00acP\u21d2(P\u2227Q)\u2261\u00ac(\u00acP)\u2228(P\u2227Q).\n$$\n\nCanceling out double negations, we reach\n\n$$\n\u00ac(\u00acP)\u2228(P\u2227Q)\u2261P\u2228(P\u2227Q).\n$$\n\nFinally, by the absorption law, we have\n\n$$\nP\u2228(P\u2227Q)\u2261P.\n$$\n\nSo the given statement is equivalent to $P.$",
